<title>USA: Rock-Tenn files for NYSE listing.</title>
<headline>Rock-Tenn files for NYSE listing.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rock-Tenn Co on Monday said it filed to list its Class A common stock on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>The company, which currently trades on the Nasdaq, said it expected to begin trading under the symbol &quot;RKT&quot; on December 31 if its application is approved.</p>
<p>The packaging company makes 100 percent recycled paperboard and recycled paperboard products.</p>
